# Tenth District Hero: "This creature becomes a Human Detective" replaces its creature types rather than adding to them (CR 205.1a). Bot1
# discards the Hero to Faithless Looting and brings it back with Call a Surprise Witness, which makes it a Human Spirit with flying. Black
# Lotus's WWW and the exiled Witness (mana value 2) pay for the first ability: it is a Detective Human 4/4 and no longer a Spirit,
# while its Flying counter keeps its flying.

[Bot1 Deck]
Tenth District Hero
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Faithless Looting
Call a Surprise Witness
Black Lotus
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

